OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed for urgent repairs to
OL,4,Arailway bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to make urgent repairs
OL,7,Fto a railway bridge which has been
OL,8,Fdamaged after being struck by vehicles.
OL,10,FThe A4010 Bradenham Road near High
OL,11,FWycombe, Buckinghamshire, which runs
OL,12,Funder the bridge, will be closed until
OL,13,F12 December.
OL,15,FNetwork Rail said a full road closure
OL,16,Fwas needed as scaffolding and
OL,17,Fspecialist equipment was needed for the
OL,18,Frepairs to be carried out.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
