OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed for urgent repairs to
OL,4,Arailway bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdam Checkley, engineering director at
OL,7,Fthe company, apologised for the
OL,8,Fdisruption and said the repairs were
OL,9,F"critical".
